    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I've been having this massive, throbbing headache for the last hour. Everything is very intense. I also noticed that when I try to speak, my words feel a bit thick and \"slurred,\" and I looked in the mirror and one side of my mouth looks a bit heavier than the other. It feels like a really intense migraine aura, right? Should I just try to sleep it off or is there something I should take for the facial heaviness?",
