      "content": "the \"difficulty speaking\" part is what i'm worried about because i'm already having that right now... it's like my tongue feels too big for my mouth. and the muscle tension thing makes sense because my neck is super stiff too. do you think i should just double up on the ibuprofen to get through the night? i really don't want to sit in an ER waiting room for hours if i can just manage this at home.",
